* astryx 0.1

** Start

*** 000 Welcome.md
# Empty Notebook

Start writing cells below.

Astryx notebooks are small folders with a source file, data folder, and output folder.

*** 001 Blank.html
<main>
  <h1>New cell</h1>
  <p>Write normal HTML here.</p>
  <button>Button</button>
</main>

*** 002 Data.json
{
  "name": "Astryx",
  "status": "empty"
}

*** 003 FirstRun.ts
ctx.text("Hello from a bounded local TypeScript cell.");
ctx.json({
  cell: "003",
  runtime: "bun",
  ok: true
});
